DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname
```

---

## 10. Helmet.js Security Features - HIGH 🟠

### Issue 10.1: Helmet Not Configured
**Severity**: HIGH
**Recommendation:**
```javascript
// Helmet with selective features enabled
app.use(helmet({
  contentSecurityPolicy: false, // Might be needed for certain apps
  hsts: {
    maxAge: 31536000,
    includeSubDomains: true,
    preload: true
  }
}));

// Or more advanced configuration
app.use(helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({
  directives: {
    defaultSrc: ["'self'"],
    styleSrc: ["'self'", "'unsafe-inline'"], // For inline styles
    imgSrc: ["'self'", 'data:', 'https:'],
    scriptSrc: ["'self'"],
    connectSrc: ["'self'"],
    mediaSrc: ["'self'"],
    objectSrc: ["'none'"],
    frameSrc: ["'none'"],
  }
