```

---

## 11. Logging and Monitoring - MEDIUM 🟡

### Issue 11.1: Poor Logging
**Severity**: MEDIUM
**Recommendation:**
```javascript
const morgan = require('morgan');

// For production
if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  app.use(morgan('combined'));
} else {
  // For development
  app.use(morgan('dev'));
}

// Custom request logging
