## Security Checklist

✅ **Do:**
- Load secrets at app startup
- Validate required secrets exist
- Never commit .env files to git
- Rotate secrets regularly
- Set appropriate permissions on .env files
- Use secret managers for production
- Cache secrets judiciously (with expiry)

❌ **Don't:**
- Code secrets directly in the application
- Log or print secrets (even partially)
- Expose secrets in URLs
- Share .env files
- Leave secrets in CI/CD logs
- Use weak secrets (short, predictable)

